      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that big of a deal though, i've had scratches like this before and they just heal up fine. honestly i'm pretty sure it's just skin irritation. if i just take a high dose of some leftover amoxicillin i have in my cabinet and keep cleaning it, that would be way faster and easier than going to a doctor, right? i just want to get rid of it quickly so i can get back to work.",
